<p style="text-align:center"><img class="lazy" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==" data-src-mobile="" data-original="https://oms.hotdeal.vn/images/editors/sources/000370758119/370758-370758-body-TET(5).jpg" /></p>

<p style="text-align:center"><br />
<img class="lazy" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==" data-src-mobile="" data-original="https://oms.hotdeal.vn/images/editors/sources/000370758119/370758-370758-body-TET(7).jpg" /></p>

<p style="text-align:center"><br />
<img class="lazy" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==" data-src-mobile="" data-original="https://oms.hotdeal.vn/images/editors/sources/000370758119/370758-370758-body-TET(4).jpg" /></p>

<p style="text-align:center">&nbsp;</p>

<p style="text-align:center"><img class="lazy" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==" data-src-mobile="" data-original="https://oms.hotdeal.vn/images/editors/sources/000370758119/370758-370758-body-TET(1).jpg" /></p>

<p style="text-align:center"><br />
<img class="lazy" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==" data-src-mobile="" data-original="https://oms.hotdeal.vn/images/editors/sources/000370758119/370758-370758-body-TET(11).jpg" /></p>

<p style="text-align:center">&nbsp;</p>

<p style="text-align:center"><img class="lazy" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==" data-src-mobile="" data-original="https://oms.hotdeal.vn/images/editors/sources/000370758119/370758-370758-body-TET(12).jpg" /></p>

<div>&nbsp;</div>

<p style="text-align:justify"><strong>Hướng dẫn di chuyển từ t&agrave;u Metro đến Suối Ti&ecirc;n:</strong><br />
1. Kh&aacute;ch xuống trạm "Đại học Quốc Gia".<br />
2. Tại trạm sẽ c&oacute; lối đi ri&ecirc;ng dẫn kh&aacute;ch đến "B&atilde;i xe số 2 v&agrave; Nh&agrave; h&agrave;ng Food Station Suối Ti&ecirc;n".<br />
3. Kh&aacute;ch di chuyển đến gần khu vực cổng ch&iacute;nh sẽ c&oacute; c&aacute;c quầy b&aacute;n v&eacute;/ đổi v&eacute; online v&agrave; mua v&eacute; v&agrave;o tham quan Suối Ti&ecirc;n.</p>

<p style="text-align:justify">&nbsp;</p>

<p style="text-align:center"><img class="lazy" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==" data-src-mobile="" data-original="https://oms.hotdeal.vn/images/editors/sources/000370758119/370758-370758-body(3).jpg" style="text-align:center" /></p>

<p style="text-align:center">&nbsp;</p>

<p style="text-align:center"><img class="lazy" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==" data-src-mobile="" data-original="https://oms.hotdeal.vn/images/editors/sources/000370758119/370758-370758-body(1).jpg" style="text-align:center" /></p>

